  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We would like to set special permissions for the Instance Owner, but this cannot be done in a Group Instance since there is no player who becomes the Instance Owner. \n\nThe Master can be changed at any time, so it is not a viable alternative. \n\nInstead of the Instance Owner, it would be acceptable to have a function that can be understood by the group's Admin or Moderator, so please add a mechanism that allows for the assignment of special permissions in Group Instances.",
